# Never version credentials, local visitor data or machine state.
**/secrets/
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/vasilisa-tts-state.json
**/probe-tools-result.json
**/node_modules/
**/.cache/
**/dist/
**/.runtime/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.pyc
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.db
**/*.jsonl
**/*.log
artifacts/workspace/
!artifacts/workspace/tests/
!artifacts/workspace/tests/**
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Pinned local toolchain downloaded by scripts/setup-tools.ps1.
/.tools/

# Visitor photos written by the dev server are personal data: only the description of the directory is versioned.
/PhotoStorage/*
!/PhotoStorage/README.md

# Results of visitors' tests written by the dev server are machine state: only the description of the directory is versioned.
/ResultStorage/*
!/ResultStorage/README.md
